people. Think about it. Over twice the population of the United States.

760
00:47:20,270 --> 00:47:26,470
Go one more generation, and you can change the entire population of the world, 8 billion people.

761
00:47:26,470 --> 00:47:32,650
If you think it's hard to change the lives of 10 people, change their lives forever, you're wrong.

762
00:47:32,650 --> 00:47:35,810
I saw it happen every day in Iraq and Afghanistan.

763
00:47:35,810 --> 00:47:39,810
A young army officer makes a decision to go left instead of

764
